# Deep paths for review-tier and ship (one extended regex per line). The build plugin's
# defaults already cover judges, auth, money, secrets, deploy, migrations and guard rails;
# these are this repo's own. A pull request touching one gets parallel bug hunters, a
# confirm vote and a separate security status.
^src/main/(localExec|localMcp|credentialStorage|mcpSecrets|updater|ipc|controlPlane|platformShell|debInstall)\.ts$
^src/preload/
^electron-builder\.(yml|json)$
^build/linux/
